uld say you're really shown of what  you are capable of in europe what we are  capable of when we bring everyone  together and what we are capable of when  we have the right leadership and we're  extremely happy that you have led us  through this crisis together with the  european commission and we're of course  extremely happy that you are here to uh  to support the the strategic exercise  that we have started ladies and  gentlemen ursula from delay  [Applause]  thank you so much prime minister dear  alexander  ministers state secretaries  distinguished guests and i'm very glad  to see the grand senior  of the vaccines professor peter piert  here in the audience too  i'm delighted to join you for this  indeed official launch of the belgium  biopharma platform today and i'm  delighted to join you especially because  it is in person  that we meet here today  and i'm explicitly mentioning this  because  a physical meeting today  would not have been possible  without the success story of the  european vaccination campaign  but this european vaccination campaign  this success story  would not have been possible without  belgium  it was in belgium  where the new mrna the life-saving mrna  vaccines have been produced for the very  first time at large scale  it was belgium  which played a key role in the clinical  trials  and it is belgium  from which europe sends a big part  of the vaccine it's exporting to  countries all over the world  i had the pleasure to visit pfizer the  fisa site in poors  it is really a true vaccine powerhouse  like so many of the world leading farm  innovation centers you have here in this  country  so today i want first and foremost  to thank you  for the steadfast support that you have  shown  you personally alexander the prime  minister  but also belgium as a whole this was  outstanding and from the bottom of my  heart many many thanks for that  i also warmly welcome the same as you've  said european direction  of the biopharma strategy that i